{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coconut Simulator 2 is a game in which you can become a coconut. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will give you a meditative gameplay. You can stand and contemplate the beauty of the beach around you living your life as a coconut. You can also perform actions that coconuts usually perform (stand in the same place).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >New Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic change of day and night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New visual effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Canonical Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a coconut</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're on the beach</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are other coconuts around you </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And not only coconuts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 game mods: arcade and realistic</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple control</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner Coconut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880190/8f8ca2d6d84996d746f9a1ee8c6345c2e2c20074.jpg"},{"name":"Noob Coconut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880190/49f75fbf671e26ed9c0927ec3f4045269082f75f.jpg"},{"name":"Ordinary Coconut","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3880190/5893f2baf64b3bb4b8e788e6a8eb17f8190c0ae6.jpg